OL,3,GNEWSAPlea not to feed ponies over
OL,4,Awelfare fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors are being urged not to feed
OL,7,Fsemi-wild ponies as it is making them
OL,8,Funwell and causing "unnecessary
OL,9,Fissues".
OL,11,FThe Dartmoor Livestock Protection
OL,12,FSociety said the animals were now
OL,13,Fwaiting in car parks in the national
OL,14,Fpark in Devon expecting to be fed,
OL,15,Fwhich was leading to health conditions
OL,16,Fsuch as colic, which can cause
OL,17,Fabdominal pain.
OL,19,FDartmoor National Park said it was
OL,20,Fillegal for people to feed the animals
OL,21,Fand if it continued, people could be
OL,22,Fcharged under the Animal Welfare Act.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
