OL,3,GNEWSAPlea not to feed ponies over
OL,4,Awelfare fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarla McKechnie, Dartmoor livestock
OL,7,Fprotection officer, said along with the
OL,8,Fhealth issues, ponies being fed by
OL,9,Fvisitors could increase the risk of
OL,10,Fthem being struck by vehicles.
